# Colaboração GPS da Vida

Márcia decides product. The Android architect orchestrates. Other agents stay in their lane.

## Work order

Architecture: [docs/adr/001-arquitetura-inicial.md](../../docs/adr/001-arquitetura-inicial.md). Next: GitHub **#1** (domain model) after **#18** lands.

## Protocol

Architect closes the contract → domain implements testable rules → app persists → UI observes state → tests cover acceptance → quality gates at batch end.

- Domain: no Android. UI: no Room, no route recalculation. App: no planning rules in ViewModels.

## New skills

Never create a Cursor skill alone. Propose name, mission, when-to-use, must-not. Wait for Márcia’s OK, then write `SKILL.md`. Same ritual to merge, split, or drop a skill.

## Product defaults

ADR 001: offline-first Android, Compose, Material 3, no backend. English code; Portuguese UI. Namespace `com.gpsdavida.app`.
